{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmh0avm2eko0","created":1793245007350,"text":"神经网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0bbf5qlc0","created":1793245041761,"text":"神经元模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0dkg19pc0","created":1793245218133,"text":"M-P神经元模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0e68csmo0","created":1793245265558,"text":"人工神经网络最基础单元。接收多个输入，每个输入带连接权重，将加权求和结果减去阈值，送入激活函数得到输出。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0dnw2ag80","created":1793245225633,"text":"两类激活函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0dwus9yw0","created":1793245245146,"text":"阶跃函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0egf8xzc0","created":1793245287743,"text":"输出 0/1，代表抑制 / 兴奋；缺点：不连续、不可导，无法用于梯度优化。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0e1eg7og0","created":1793245255043,"text":"Sigmoid函数"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0ds0j97k0","created":1793245234610,"text":"神经网络"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0bf4dkcg0","created":1793245049816,"text":"感知机与多层网络"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0bja8fjs0","created":1793245058877,"text":" 误差逆传播算法（BP算法）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0dawbxuw0","created":1793245197351,"text":"全局最小与局部极小"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0ddvnt2g0","created":1793245203840,"text":"其他常见神经网络"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}